<title>USA: Four companies bid for U.S. Stockpile platinum.</title>
<headline>Four companies bid for U.S. Stockpile platinum.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four companies presented bids for stockpiled platinum, the Defense National Stockpile Center said.</p>
<p>Fleet Precious Metals, A-1 Specialized, Mitsubishi International and Johnson Matthey all bid for several lots at 100 percent of the London fixing price.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
